[
  {
    "type": "opener",
    "page": "linear",
    "secnum": {
      "en": "SECTION 04",
      "zh": "第 04 节"
    },
    "h1": {
      "en": "Linear motion",
      "zh": "直线运动"
    },
    "lede": {
      "en": "PhysiClaw's X/Y motion uses a CoreXY arrangement, guided by three MGN9H linear rails: two run left and right as the Y axis, and one spans between them as the X axis. Each of the two points where the X axis meets the Y rails carries two idler assemblies.",
      "zh": "PhysiClaw 的 X/Y 运动采用 CoreXY 方案，靠三根 MGN9H 导轨导向：左右两根作 Y 轴，横跨其间的一根作 X 轴。X 轴与 Y 导轨相接的两处各装两个惰轮组。"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "wide-top",
    "page": "linear_10",
    "head": {
      "title": {
        "en": "LINEAR MOTION",
        "zh": "直线运动"
      },
      "small": "linear_10"
    },
    "figures": [
      {
        "src": "linear_10_y_exploded_cam0_jwgq.svg"
      },
      {
        "src": "linear_10_y_assembled_cam0.svg"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Install the carriage",
          "zh": "安装滑块"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Some carriages ship on a plastic dummy rail. Align it with the guide rail and slide the carriage across. Never remove the dummy rail first, or the balls will fall out and ruin the carriage.",
          "zh": "有些滑块出厂时套在塑料假轨上。安装时把假轨与导轨端面对齐，将滑块推入导轨。不要先抽出假轨，否则钢珠会掉出，滑块随即报废。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:16mm; top:30mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Build two Y rails",
          "zh": "做两条 Y 导轨"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The Y axis uses two identical rails.",
          "zh": "Y 轴使用两条相同的导轨。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:120mm; top:95mm; width:60mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Clean and grease the rails",
          "zh": "清洁导轨并涂润滑脂"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "MGN9H rails come coated in anti-rust oil. Wipe it off before installing, then add some fresh grease to the carriage so it runs smoothly and lasts longer. Keep it away from water the whole time.",
          "zh": "MGN9H 导轨出厂时涂有防锈油。安装前将其擦净，再给滑块涂新的润滑脂，滑动更顺畅、更耐用。全程避免接触水。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:120mm; bottom:25mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Let the T-nuts hang",
          "zh": "先让 T 型螺母悬吊"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Thread an M3×10 FHCS into every other hole and let its drop-in T-nut dangle on the screw tip. Lower the whole rail onto the extrusion slot, then tighten to draw the nuts up snug.",
          "zh": "每隔一个孔拧入一颗 M3×10 沉头螺栓，船形螺母悬吊在螺栓末端。把整条导轨放入型材槽，再拧紧螺栓，把螺母拉起夹紧。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:80mm; width:74mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Mind the carriage",
          "zh": "当心滑块"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The carriage slides off the rail end with little effort, and a dropped one spills its ball bearings, ruining it. Keep it on the rail, and never swap carriages between rails.",
          "zh": "滑块稍一用力就会从导轨端头滑出，一旦掉落，钢珠散出，滑块随即报废。滑块应始终留在导轨上，不同导轨的滑块不要互换。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:16mm; top:90mm; width:60mm; display:flex; gap:4mm; align-items:flex-start;",
        "icon": "info"
      }
    ],
    "bom": {
      "label": {
        "en": "Bill of materials",
        "zh": "物料清单"
      },
      "rows": [
        {
          "component": {
            "en": "Linear rail",
            "zh": "直线导轨"
          },
          "spec": "MGN9H, 240 mm",
          "qty": "2"
        },
        {
          "component": {
            "en": "FHCS",
            "zh": "沉头螺栓"
          },
          "spec": "M3×10",
          "qty": "12"
        },
        {
          "component": {
            "en": "T-nut",
            "zh": "T 型螺母"
          },
          "spec": { "en": "Drop-In M3", "zh": "船形螺母 M3" },
          "qty": "12"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "main-inset-br",
    "page": "linear_11",
    "head": {
      "title": {
        "en": "LINEAR MOTION",
        "zh": "直线运动"
      },
      "small": "linear_11"
    },
    "main": {
      "src": "linear_11_y_exploded_cam1_xjoj.svg"
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Install the rails",
          "zh": "安装导轨"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Adjust the idler mounts away from the motor so both ends of each Y rail sit snug against them.",
          "zh": "调整远离电机一侧的惰轮支座，使 Y 导轨两端紧靠支座。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:5mm; top:0mm; width:60mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Fix the Y rails, but not tight",
          "zh": "先固定 Y 导轨，暂不拧紧"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Hold both Y rails in place with the bolts snug, not fully tightened. Only once the X axis is installed and travels smoothly should you torque them down.",
          "zh": "两条 Y 导轨的螺栓拧到贴合即可，暂不完全拧紧。等 X 轴装好并移动顺畅后再拧紧。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:120mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Tighten from the middle out",
          "zh": "从中间向两边拧紧"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "When you do tighten, start at the center bolt and work outward so the rail beds down flush against the extrusion.",
          "zh": "正式拧紧时从中间的螺栓开始向两边拧，使导轨平贴型材。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:0mm; top:0mm; width:55mm;"
      }
    ],
    "notesInside": true
  },
