    },
    "main": {
      "src": "linear_31_x_exploded_cam1_opwr.svg",
      "style": "transform: translateX(-20mm);"
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Check the X beam slides smoothly",
          "zh": "检查 X 横梁滑动是否顺畅"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The X beam should glide freely along the Y rails. If it binds, realign the Y rails until it runs smoothly, then tighten them from the center bolt outward.",
          "zh": "X 横梁应能沿 Y 导轨自由滑动。如果发涩，重新校正 Y 导轨直到滑动顺畅，再从中间的螺栓向两边拧紧。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:50mm; width:60mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Be patient",
          "zh": "需要耐心"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Don't expect to get it in one pass. Snug a few screws, slide the X beam to feel the resistance, then nudge the Y rails and try again. It can take a few minutes of back-and-forth before the beam glides smoothly.",
          "zh": "调整通常无法一次到位。拧上几颗螺栓，推动 X 横梁感受阻力，再微调 Y 导轨，如此反复。可能需要来回调整几分钟，横梁才能顺畅滑动。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:100mm; width:60mm;"
      }
    ],
    "bom": {
      "label": {
        "en": "Bill of materials",
        "zh": "物料清单"
      },
      "rows": [
        {
